  "instructions": [
    "In a large pot, heat the ground nut oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the flour and cook for 1-2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Gradually add the cold water, whisking continuously to prevent lumps.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "Stir in the nutritional yeast, thyme, salt, and pepper.",
    "Add the chopped green onions and parsley, and stir to combine.",
    "Serve the dumplings hot, garnished with additional green onions and parsley if desired."
